      "id": "claim_fec0ab24720e482a86ef99423b907ea5",
      "statement": "The active API routes registered in PSPConnectorVertical are POST and PUT to /payments, POST to /verify-otp and /verify-otp2, PATCH to /authorizations/:id, and POST to /refunds2.",
